---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-12 border-t" style="border-color: var(--line);">
  <div class="site-shell grid gap-10 py-12 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr_0.8fr]">
    <div>
      <div class="font-display text-2xl font-bold">YMLL Blog</div>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7" style="color: var(--muted);">把复杂问题写清楚，把长期兴趣沉淀为可检索的知识。这里记录工程、研究与成长。</p>
      <a href={`${base}/rss.xml`} class="button-secondary mt-5">订阅 RSS</a>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="页脚导航">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em]" style="color: var(--muted);">探索</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm">
        <a href={`${base}/blog`} class="hover:underline">全部文章</a>
        <a href={`${base}/archive`} class="hover:underline">时间归档</a>
        <a href={`${base}/tags`} class="hover:underline">主题标签</a>
        <a href={`${base}/about`} class="hover:underline">关于作者</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em]" style="color: var(--muted);">连接</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm">
        <a href="https://github.com/yanmengli123" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline">GitHub ↗</a>
        <a href={`${base}/admin/index.html`} class="hover:underline">内容管理</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t" style="border-color: var(--line);">
    <div class="site-shell flex flex-col gap-2 py-5 text-xs sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between" style="color: var(--muted);">
      <p>© 2024–{year} YMLL. 内容保留，欢迎引用。</p>
      <p>Astro · Markdown · Git</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
